{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"screens\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无。离开熟悉生活后的短暂释然、随之而来的空落，以及对未来缺乏依靠的迷茫都理解准确。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无。怀念过去、提醒自己曾受的委屈，以及不甘心连过去的美好也一并放弃，三层矛盾都拼对了。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"score\": 1,\n      \"wrong\": \"无具体误读。本屏没有大字号的“话”，只有小字号的感受和音乐旁注，因此确实无法凭大字拼出内容。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"score\": 1,\n      \"wrong\": \"无具体误读。本屏没有大字号的“话”，只有小字号的感受和音乐旁注，无法凭大字还原。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"score\": 1,\n      \"wrong\": \"无具体误读。本屏没有大字号的“话”，只有小字号的感受和音乐旁注，无法凭大字还原。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无。重新怀念过去的亲近关系、不再用曾经的委屈压制想念，以及意识到陪伴的珍贵，都理解准确。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无。独自面对未来的恐惧、对离开决定的重新怀疑，以及既想找回亲近又不愿重新受委屈的矛盾，都拼对了。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"score\": 1,\n      \"wrong\": \"无具体误读。本屏没有大字号的“话”，只有小字号的感受和音乐旁注，无法凭大字拼出内容。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"score\": 1,\n      \"wrong\": \"无具体误读。本屏没有大字号的“话”，只有小字号的感受和音乐旁注，无法凭大字拼出内容。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无。最舍不得的是曾经被当作自己人的感觉，但过去的伤害无法抹去，因此不能仅凭怀念就放心回去，这一核心矛盾理解准确。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"score\": 1,\n      \"wrong\": \"无具体误读。本屏没有大字号的“话”，只有小字号的感受和音乐旁注，无法凭大字拼出内容。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无。承认过去既有委屈也有美好，不再责怪自己离开，也不为获得陪伴而勉强回头，准确抓住了这一屏的转变。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无。期待重新获得亲近关系，同时做好独自生活、不再为了留住别人而忍受委屈的准备，理解准确。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"story\": 4,\n  \"story_note\": \"全曲故事的核心完全一致：离开曾经既有美好也有伤害的生活，在失去陪伴后重新怀念亲近与归属，经历矛盾和动摇，最终接纳过去的两面，带着想念继续生活而不再牺牲自己。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "d02576bc-fe67-4dcd-8792-e11e785d075d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T185047468347Z", "elapsed_seconds": 93.641, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T18:52:21.126969+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a0bf4c9989431a9161c53d6383cd0e2051b2a1d30afbd63eb97b9bc97e4c8a2d", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T185047468347Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "25735d2c9cfc99a0c25fd951f2198dd09a319d1236a89aba6e87ddbba6eb4e02"}}}
